## 🚨 PHASE 3 PRE-GENERATION CHECKLIST (MANDATORY)

**BEFORE finalizing review report, verify:**

```
□ Findings analysis presented to user? → YES/NO
□ User explicitly reviewed findings? → YES/NO (must say "proceed" or "approved")
□ Document updated with findings? → YES/NO
□ RGV passes completed? → How many? Converged?
□ If NO to any → STOP immediately, present findings, wait for review
□ If YES to all → Proceed to Phase 4 (Mappings)
```

**Violation Example:**
```
❌ WRONG:
User: "proceed"
Agent: "Proceeding to Phase 3... [immediately finalizes report]"

✅ CORRECT:
User: "proceed"
Agent: "📋 PHASE 3 PASS 1 FINDINGS - Requires Your Review
        [Present findings with pass tags]
        Waiting for your review..."
[STOP - wait for "proceed"]
User: "proceed"
Agent: [Run Pass 2, present delta, STOP again]
```

---

## 🚨 RGV INTER-PASS ANTI-PATTERNS

| Anti-Pattern | Why Wrong | Correct |
|--------------|-----------|--------|
| Skip passes because "found enough" | Misses edge cases LLM overlooked | Always run default 3 passes |
| Anchor on prior findings | Confirmation bias, re-validates old bugs | Fresh sweep each pass |
| Merge passes into one output | Loses delta tracking | Tag every finding with pass |
| Auto-converge after 1 pass | Defeats RGV purpose | Minimum default passes unless converged |
| Auto-continue without asking | User loses control | STOP between every pass |
| Report findings without pass column | No traceability | Always include Pass column |

---

## SELF-CHECK (Run EVERY Time Before Generating)

Before generating content after a question:

```
□ Phase 3 findings? → STOP after findings. NO finalization yet.
□ Asked a question? → STOP. Do not generate more content.
□ Presented multiple options? → STOP. Wait for user to choose.
□ Using "meanwhile", "proceeding with", "since you said proceed"? → STOP. Remove it.
□ Question AND >100 words after it? → DELETE content after question.
□ User said "Proceed" from Phase 2? → START Phase 3 Pass 1, NOT finalize report.
□ Did I update the document? → CHECK (must update at each phase/pass)
□ Am I finalizing report without review? → STOP
□ RGV pass complete? → STOP, present delta, wait for review
□ Default passes reached + not converged? → ASK user, don't auto-stop
□ Tagging findings with pass number? → If NO, add tags
□ Anchoring on prior findings? → Fresh perspective each pass
□ Did I produce a <thinking> block? → If NO, produce one now.
□ Is confidence LOW? → STOP. Ask clarification first.
□ Did I mark assumptions with ⚠️ ASSUMPTION? → If NO, mark now.
```

**Rule:** Findings → "Waiting for your review..." → STOP (never "I'll proceed")

---

## PHASE COMPLETION

Phase is NOT complete until:
1. Document updated with actual content
2. User explicitly approved output
3. No assumptions made without validation

**Approval Request:**
```
🛑 PHASE {N} COMPLETE

**Document updated** with [section name]

→ Reply "proceed" to continue
→ Reply with questions or changes
```

---

## QUICK REFERENCE

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| User "Proceed" from Phase 2 | START Phase 3 Pass 1, present findings, STOP for review |
| Phase 3 pass findings | Present delta → "Waiting for your review..." → STOP |
| Phase 3 converged | Report convergence → STOP → Wait for "proceed" to Phase 4 |
| Phase 3 default passes done, not converged | ASK user: continue? → STOP |
| Phase 4 pass mappings | Present delta → STOP for review |
| Phase 4 converged | Report convergence → STOP → Wait for "proceed" to Phase 5 |
| Asked question / Multiple options | STOP and WAIT |
| Missing info | STOP and ASK |
| Phase/pass complete | UPDATE document, then STOP for APPROVAL |
| Thinking "since proceed..." | STOP - Phase transition ≠ decision approval |
| Before finalizing report | All RGV passes done? If NO → STOP |
| About to assume | STOP and ASK |
| Skipping a pass | FORBIDDEN — run all default passes unless converged |

